# Local agent-harness state. Kept out of the repo on purpose: these files carry
# personal choices (permission mode) and machine state (pids, session ids), and
# committing a permission-bypass setting would silently disable another
# contributor's prompts on clone. Share a team config only by un-ignoring a
# deliberately written file — never by committing whatever happens to be here.
.claude/

# Subagent-driven-development scratch: ledger, task briefs, review packages.
# Session-local coordination state, never part of the product.
.superpowers/
